        "original_id": "da157334-66d1-5352-a9b9-a3d36411e24c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Ainslee's Magazine, The Australian Women's Weekly, Strand Magazine, The Prince and Betty\n- Companies: Bauer Media Group\n- Places: United States, United Kingdom, Sydney\n- Topics: publication history, serial publication\n\nFacts:\n- Ainslee's Magazine was an American literary periodical published from 1897 to December 1926.\n- The Prince and Betty was originally published in Ainslee's Magazine in the United States in January 1912.\n- The Prince and Betty was published in a slightly different form as a serial in Strand Magazine in the United Kingdom between February and April 1912.\n- The Australian Women's Weekly is an Australian monthly women's magazine published by Bauer Media Group in Sydney.",
